  "retainedEarlierAttempts": "The initial validator batch incorrectly expected PDF/A-2a to reject a deliberately missing catalog language; veraPDF accepted that PDF/A check and rejected the same control under PDF/UA-1. The two validator scopes are now reported separately without changing either verdict. An initial focused compile failed CA1861 for an inline constant array in a test; a static fixture corrected it. A source edit overlapped an earlier test build, so a fresh rebuild was run after editing stopped.",
